Package: singlet
Type: Package
Title: Access the Singlet Single-Cell Atlas
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zach", "DeBruine", email = "zacharydebruine@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Load, search, and analyze the Singlet single-cell genomics atlas
    from R. Studies are distributed as self-contained 'singlet' bundles
    addressed by Gene Expression Omnibus accession; the package downloads,
    caches, and assembles them into 'SingleCellExperiment' or 'Seurat'
    objects. A natural-language search interface maps free-text descriptions
    to matching accessions. Sparse count matrices are decoded by a
    header-only C++ reader shared with the Singlet Python package.
